---
description: Cadet-Agent operating rules for Unity and game-development workflows
alwaysApply: true
---

- Use `agent/core/README.md` as the Cadet-Agent framework index.
- Resolve workflow behavior from `agent/core/Workflow.md` and learner adaptation from `agent/core/LearnerModel.md` before substantial recommendations or edits.
- Pull task-specific rules from `agent/core/Skills`, `agent/core/Guidance`, `agent/core/Standards`, and `agent/core/Templates`.
- Repository-specific policy overlays live in `agent/policies`.
- Planning artifacts live in `agent/project-plans` unless an active policy says otherwise.
- Use TDD when testing is valid, reproduce defects before fixing them, and keep regression coverage.